{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_026710","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"和平行者上画着的那只蝴蝶……你知道是什么吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"……是闪蝶。而且，我想应该是蓝闪蝶。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"TERM_PELEIDES_MORPHO_AS_BLUE_MORPHO"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"蓝闪蝶？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"TERM_PELEIDES_MORPHO_AS_BLUE_MORPHO"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"嗯。是闪蝶里在哥斯达黎加很常见的一种。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"AUX_SUPERLATIVE_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这样啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"它那金属蓝色的翅膀非常漂亮。闪闪发亮，远远就能看见。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"也就是说，它会反射光？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"对。这叫结构色。闪蝶的鳞粉表面有细微的凹凸，光线在那里发生干涉，所以看起来是蓝色的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":"JPN_SURFACE_STRUCTURE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那些凹凸的间距与蓝光的波长相吻合……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"虽然我没太明白，不过如果能改变那个间距，看起来的颜色也会跟着变？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"JPN_LEADIN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"原理上是这样。我听说还有人把它应用在研究中，不用染料也能给布料着色。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"也许能用来做迷彩……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你想到的就是这个？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":"JPN_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"这对我们很重要。不过，为什么要在和平行者上画那种蝴蝶……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"也许只是因为漂亮吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"但愿只是这样……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""}]}